"id": "section-1",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section\"><div class=\"shell text-column regional-guide\"><h2>Plumbing and electrical repairs in Eastern Suburbs</h2><p>For an Eastern Suburbs electrical repair request, identify the affected area or circuit only if it can be observed safely. Pair that with the property access contact and any separate plumbing concern.</p><h3>Plumbing repairs, drainage and hot water</h3><p>Eastern Suburbs bookings cover plumbing repairs in homes, rentals and managed premises, including kitchen and laundry connections, drainage and hot water. A replacement fixture or appliance should be assessed against the existing connections and access, not assumed to fit because its external dimensions are similar. Our <a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">fixture and appliance connection service</a> distinguishes plumbing connections from any electrical requirements.</p><p>For drainage faults, our <a href=\"blocked-drains-perth.html\">blocked drain clearing and repair service</a> investigates the affected fixtures and recurring symptoms. Visible water beside a connection or in a neighbouring room is assessed through <a href=\"water-leak-detection-perth.html\">water leak detection</a>. The repair plan explains the identified source and whether access to a concealed pipe is required.</p><p>Hot-water equipment can involve both water connections and an electrical supply. Request <a href=\"hot-water-problems-perth.html\">hot-water repairs or replacement assessment</a> with the location and observed supply change. We assess the existing installation before quoting equipment replacement or additional connection work.</p><h3>Electrical repairs and installation</h3><p>For circuit outages and switchboard concerns, our <a href=\"power-faults-perth.html\">electrical fault finding service</a> establishes the reported fault before a repair is proposed. A recurring trip may require investigation of the connected load or installation; it is not evidence on its own that the entire board needs replacement.</p><p>Our <a href=\"safety-switch-tripping-perth.html\">safety switch and RCD repair service</a> assesses devices that trip repeatedly or will not remain on. For additional outlets, replacement lighting or altered equipment connections, we discuss the intended use and existing circuit requirements. Do not remove a switchboard cover, handle damaged cables or repeatedly reset a device to collect information.</p><p>Work is carried out by appropriately licensed plumbing and electrical trades. Licence details are available on request. Our Perth team has an independent office and repair team within Ellis Services Group.</p><h2>Written quote before work proceeds</h2><p>Investigation, component repair and new installation are different scopes. The written quote identifies the proposed work, replacement materials, connections and any additional access or circuit work. A request to connect equipment does not automatically include alterations to the existing supply or building finishes.</p><p>Once the scope is approved, our appropriately licensed trades carry out the agreed plumbing or electrical work. Findings that change the job are explained before extra work proceeds. The completion handover identifies the completed tasks and any separate follow-up requirement.</p><h2>What to include in a repair request</h2><p>For premises with controlled entry or an on-site representative, include the site contact, opening arrangements and which rooms or equipment areas require access. Distinguish a fault repair from a planned fit-out or appliance connection so the service request reflects the work you need.</p><p>Property managers can include a work-order reference, reported symptoms and the person authorised to discuss the quote. Where a repair affects occupants or shared services, tell us the relevant coordination arrangements. We agree the repair scope and access with the nominated contact rather than assuming an occupant can authorise every task.</p><p>Call <a href=\"tel:0413477667\">0413 477 667</a> or <a href=\"contact.html\">request an on-site assessment and written quote</a>. You do not need to diagnose the fault before making contact.</p><h3>Suburbs within this service region</h3><p>Choose your suburb to prefill the property location in our contact form: <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Belmont\">Belmont</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Cloverdale\">Cloverdale</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Kewdale\">Kewdale</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Redcliffe\">Redcliffe</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Ascot\">Ascot</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Bayswater\">Bayswater</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Maylands\">Maylands</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Bedford\">Bedford</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Bassendean\">Bassendean</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Ashfield\">Ashfield</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Guildford\">Guildford</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Midland\">Midland</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Woodbridge\">Woodbridge</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Viveash\">Viveash</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Forrestfield\">Forrestfield</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=High%20Wycombe\">High Wycombe</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Maida%20Vale\">Maida Vale</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Hazelmere\">Hazelmere</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=South%20Guildford\">South Guildford</a>, <a href=\"contact.html?suburb=Morley\">Morley</a>.</p><p>See <a href=\"service-areas.html\">all six Perth service regions</a> for our wider coverage.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
