"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq\"><div class=\"shell text-column regional-guide\"><h2>Eastern Suburbs plumber and electrician FAQ</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>Explain site access before arranging the assessment</h3><p>For a property with controlled entry, a shared driveway or operating restrictions, give the nominated access contact and any required check-in arrangements. State whether the request concerns a home, rental or other premises. The proposed task still needs scope confirmation; an address near commercial or airport facilities does not imply specialist industrial capability.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"property-management.html\">Access and work-order information</a></li><li><a href=\"electrical.html\">Electrical tasks and service boundaries</a></li><li><a href=\"plumbing.html\">Plumbing work in eastern Perth</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
