"html": "\n<section class=\"section electrical-work-gallery-section\"><div class=\"shell text-column\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Electrical work examples</span><h2>Electrical switchboard, lighting and power-point work</h2><p>Company electrical work photographs illustrate installation and repair stages. They are not assigned to a particular suburb without project-location records. Contact Ellis Services Group to discuss the work at your property.</p></div><div class=\"shell\" data-electrical-work-gallery><div class=\"electrical-work-gallery\"><div class=\"electrical-work-gallery__heading\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Real work imagery</span><h2>Electrical work examples</h2><p>Electrical switchboard, lighting and power-point work.</p></div><div class=\"electrical-work-gallery__grid\"><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-in-progress-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-in-progress-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-in-progress-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Kitchen ceiling with recessed lights being fitted\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Kitchen lighting work</strong><span>Lighting work in progress.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-wide-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Wide view of a kitchen with recessed lights\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Kitchen lighting work</strong><span>Kitchen lighting presentation.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-finished-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-finished-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/kitchen-lighting-finished-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Kitchen with illuminated recessed ceiling lights\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Kitchen lighting work</strong><span>Completed lighting presentation.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/cabinet-cabling-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/cabinet-cabling-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/cabinet-cabling-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Electrical cabinet with cabling and conduit\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Cabling work</strong><span>Cabling installation-stage work.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/underground-electrical-conduit-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/underground-electrical-conduit-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/underground-electrical-conduit-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Underground trench with electrical conduit\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Conduit work</strong><span>Underground conduit installation-stage work.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/renovation-rewiring-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/renovation-rewiring-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/renovation-rewiring-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Open renovation wall with electrical wiring\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Renovation wiring</strong><span>Electrical rough-in during renovation work.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/residential-switchboard-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/residential-switchboard-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/residential-switchboard-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Residential electrical switchboard with its cover open\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Switchboard work</strong><span>Residential switchboard work example.</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"electrical-work-gallery__card\"><img class=\"electrical-work-gallery__image\" src=\"/images/electrical-work/safety-switch-closeup-480.webp\" srcset=\"/images/electrical-work/safety-switch-closeup-480.webp 480w, /images/electrical-work/safety-switch-closeup-960.webp 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width:700px) 50vw, (max-width:980px) 33vw, 25vw\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" alt=\"Close-up of a safety switch and circuit breakers\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><strong>Safety-switch work</strong><span>Safety-switch work example.</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
